        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Virus Structure and Genome Organization",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Viruses are minimal nucleic acid delivery systems. Structure is tightly optimized\nfor: genome protection, receptor recognition, membrane penetration, and immune\nevasion. Everything else is stripped out."
    },
    {
      "id": "01-VIRUS-STRUCTURE.md#003",
      "path": [
        "01-VIRUS-STRUCTURE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:virology:01-virus-structure, git-history:virology:01-virus-structure]",
        "canonical_path": "virology/01-VIRUS-STRUCTURE.md",
        "concepts": "[virus, structure]",
        "current_path": "virology/01-VIRUS-STRUCTURE.md",
        "id": "maxim:virology:virus-structure",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "virology",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[virus, structure]",
        "section": "virology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Virus Structure and Genome Organization",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                VIRUS STRUCTURAL HIERARCHY                        │\n│                                                                  │\n│  GENOME                                                          │\n│  ─────── DNA or RNA, ss or ds, linear or circular, segmented     │\n│     │                                                            │\n│     ▼                                                            │\n│  CAPSID SHELL                                                    │\n│  ──────────── Protein coat: icosahedral / helical / complex      │\n│     │                                                            │\n│     ▼ (in enveloped viruses)                                     │\n│  MATRIX PROTEINS (some viruses)                                  │\n│  ──────────────────────────────                                  │\n│     │                                                            │\n│     ▼ (in enveloped viruses)                                     │\n│  LIPID ENVELOPE                                                  │\n│  ────────────── Stolen from host membrane                        │\n│     │                                                            │\n│     ▼ (in enveloped viruses)                                     │\n│  SURFACE GLYCOPROTEINS                                           │\n│  ─────────────────────── Receptor binding, membrane fusion       │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```"
    },
